# Placeholder config for slowapi (see server/limiter.py). Keep it committed.
# Starlette opens this file with the locale encoding (GBK on Chinese Windows),
# so it must stay ASCII-only and must exist: Limiter(config_filename=...) raises
# FileNotFoundError for a missing path. No settings are read from here; app
# secrets stay in the root .env, which python-dotenv loads as UTF-8.

